  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Programa de Asociaciones Pblico Privadas (APP) de Colombia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Colombia&apos;s Public-Private Partnerships (PPP) Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir a reducir la brecha en la provisin y calidad de los servicios de
infraestructura productiva y social, incrementando la competitividad y el crecimiento econmico. El objetivo
especfico del programa es contribuir a incrementar la inversin privada en la provisin y gestin de
infraestructura productiva y social, a travs de la consolidacin de la poltica pblica para la vinculacin de la
participacin privada, a nivel nacional y territorial.

La presente operacin de prstamo es la primera de dos consecutivas de un solo tramo cada una, vinculadas
tcnicamente entre s, pero financiadas en forma independiente bajo la modalidad de Prstamo Programtico
de Apoyo a Reformas de Poltica (PBP).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to help reduce the gap in the provision and quality of productive and
social infrastructure services and increase competitiveness and economic growth. The specific objective of the
program is to help increase private investment in the provision and management of productive and social
infrastructure, through the consolidation of public policy for enlisting private sector participation at the national
and subnational levels.

This loan operation is the first of two consecutive single-tranche operations that are linked technically but will
be financed separately under the programmatic policy-based loan (PBL) modality.</narrative>
  </description>
